      "prompt": "Hedgehogs interpret complexity through one grand organizing theory, while foxes weave insights from diverse, often contradictory perspectives. Think about a recent high-stakes belief you held about social trends, career shifts, or politics. Did you rely on a single dominant ideological lens, or did you piece together an eclectic patchwork of competing ideas?",
