      "title": "Brier Score Personal Ledger",
      "prompt": "Superforecasting requires keeping score without emotional revisionism. Imagine maintaining an immutable ledger tracking your quarterly prognostications with concrete deadlines and numerical odds. How would knowing your track record is quantitatively audited alter the boldness or caution of your assertions?",
      "placeholder": "Reflect on how transparent, numerical accountability changes your intellectual humility..."
